      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "iMOVE are delighted to present No. 17 Belvedere Square, a spacious and well-proportioned five-bedroom terraced home ideally positioned within the established Belvedere Court development in the heart of Dublin City Centre.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 130 sq.m. over four levels, this impressive property offers exceptionally versatile accommodation with generous living spaces and five well-sized bedrooms, making it an ideal purchase for owner-occupiers, investors or those seeking a centrally located home with ample space.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway leading to a bright open-plan living, dining and kitchen area. The first floor boasts an impressive reception room featuring high ceilings, a feature fireplace and an attractive open-to-below aspect, creating a bright and spacious living environment. The upper floors provide five generously proportioned bedrooms and two bathrooms, offering excellent flexibility for family living, guests or home office use.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from large feature windows throughout, allowing an abundance of natural light to flood the accommodation, while the practical layout ensures excellent separation between living and sleeping areas.\r\n\r\nBelvedere Court enjoys an enviable city centre location within walking distance of O'Connell Street, Croke Park, IFSC, Connolly Station, the Mater Hospital, Trinity College and a host of cafés, restaurants, shops and public transport links including LUAS and Dublin Bus services.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial city residence in one of Dublin's most convenient and accessible locations."
      },
